{
 "about": "Which RS256 issuers knos-oidc can verify, the claims each signs (the SHAPE recorded from the issuer's documentation, with example values) and which of them a program can gate on. Key sizes were read from each issuer's published key set on the `checked` day. tests/test_issuers.py verifies a token of each shape, signed by a test key, in the test build of the verifier; it also holds docs/VERIFIER.md and web/verifier.js to this file.",
 "checked": "2026-10-05",
 "accepts": {
  "alg": "RS256",
  "key_bits": [
   2048,
   4096
  ],
  "max_token_bytes": 8192,
  "max_issuer_url_bytes": 200,
  "exp": "a number, at most one day ahead of the chain's clock; a token is read until one hour after it"
